I see the issue now - the error says "before initialization" which means the variable IS being hoisted but we're in the TDZ. Actually, looking at the error more carefully, line 1606 is where we're SETTING it, not reading it. The error must be from line 1622 where we READ it. Let me look at the event listener setup order:

