<b>🌿 You are 1mm tall</b><br>
<span id="scale">Scale: Ant-sized</span><br>
<span id="hands">👋 Checking hands...</span><br>
<span id="fps">FPS: --</span><br>
WASD+Mouse | Space=Up | P=Pause Insects<br>
<button onclick="changeScale(0.0001)">🦠 Microscopic (0.1mm)</button>
<button onclick="changeScale(0.001)">🐜 Ant (1mm)</button>
