#### Option 1: Thumbstick Locomotion (Standard)
```javascript
// Left thumbstick = move
// Right thumbstick = turn

const gamepad = renderer.xr.getController(0).gamepad;

if (gamepad) {
    const leftStickX = gamepad.axes[2];  // Left stick horizontal
    const leftStickY = gamepad.axes[3];  // Left stick vertical
    
