### 2. **LOD (Level of Detail) SYSTEM**

**RAGE's Approach:**
```
Distance from camera:
  0-50m   → Full detail (100% polygons)
  50-150m → Medium (50% polygons)
  150-300m → Low (25% polygons)
  300m+   → Billboard (flat sprite)
```

**Why This Matters:**
- A building 500m away doesn't need 100K polygons
- Use 1K polygons (billboard texture)
- Save 99% of GPU power!

**Our Implementation:**
```javascript
class LODManager {
    constructor() {
        this.lodLevels = [
            { distance: 50, detail: 1.0 },   // Full
            { distance: 150, detail: 0.5 },  // Half
            { distance: 300, detail: 0.25 }, // Quarter
            { distance: Infinity, detail: 0 } // Billboard
        ];
    }
    
    update(objects, camera) {
        objects.forEach(obj => {
            const distance = camera.position.distanceTo(obj.position);
            const lodLevel = this.getLODLevel(distance);
            obj.setLOD(lodLevel);
        });
    }
}
```

